
Package: coolboxgui
Type: Package
Title: CoolBox GUI and Machine Learning Primitives
Version: 0.1.0
Author: CoolBox Contributors
Maintainer: CoolBox Team <contact@meandering.ai>
Description: R bindings for CoolBox GUI primitives (Toolbar, DockPanel, LayerList, PropertyInspector, FileTree, RadioSelector, CheckboxGroup) and machine learning primitives (Tensor, Model, Optimizer, Loss, Dataset, Trainer, and related utilities). This package enables R users to access both advanced GUI components and machine learning features from the CoolBox toolkit.
License: MIT
LinkingTo: Rcpp
Imports: Rcpp
